{"id":5233,"date":"2025-08-27T16:02:22","date_gmt":"2025-08-27T16:02:22","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/?p=5233"},"modified":"2025-09-25T20:07:42","modified_gmt":"2025-09-25T13:07:42","slug":"gmv-max-khong-can-tien","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/kien-thuc-tiktok\/gmv-max-khong-can-tien\/","title":{"rendered":"GMV Max kh\u00f4ng c\u1eafn ti\u1ec1n ph\u1ea3i l\u00e0m sao?"},"content":{"rendered":"<div data-page-id=\"Kd8cdNrIEo6xAzx8fxllbtN6gac\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-V0mBdAr1KoJPAaxgWLqlrR5qg7e\">B\u1ea1n \u0111\u00e3 c\u1ea9n th\u1eadn thi\u1ebft l\u1eadp m\u1ed9t chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch GMV Max v\u1edbi k\u1ef3 v\u1ecdng b\u00f9ng n\u1ed5 doanh thu, nh\u01b0ng sau nhi\u1ec1u gi\u1edd ch\u1edd \u0111\u1ee3i, ng\u00e2n s\u00e1ch v\u1eabn &#8220;im l\u00ecm&#8221; kh\u00f4ng h\u1ec1 suy chuy\u1ec3n? T\u00ecnh tr\u1ea1ng qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o kh\u00f4ng &#8220;c\u1eafn ti\u1ec1n&#8221; l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t v\u1ea5n \u0111\u1ec1 ph\u1ed5 bi\u1ebfn nh\u01b0ng l\u1ea1i g\u00e2y ra kh\u00f4ng \u00edt hoang mang. Trong b\u00e0i vi\u1ebft n\u00e0y,<strong><a href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\"> Lemon Digital<\/a><\/strong> s\u1ebd ph\u00e2n t\u00edch c\u00e1c nguy\u00ean nh\u00e2n c\u1ed1t l\u00f5i v\u00e0 h\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn b\u1ea1n c\u00e1ch kh\u1eafc ph\u1ee5c chi ti\u1ebft \u0111\u1ec3 chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng tr\u1edf l\u1ea1i.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-WnbrdGYNnow6pIxNcWIl7wXwgIe\">GMV Max kh\u00f4ng &#8220;c\u1eafn ti\u1ec1n&#8221; l\u00e0 g\u00ec?<\/h2>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-KSDYdZ9Zso2WyExZbUTlwU76gxc\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;a16ff281-0357-4e5f-8215-6951944cbca7&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FRwMwb1hIsowY1Ox5bhglWN91gqg%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;RwMwb1hIsowY1Ox5bhglWN91gqg&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:429685,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_5234\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5234\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5234\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/cb887a88-f378-45d8-96dd-3c1b023789a2.png\" alt=\"GMV Max kh\u00f4ng &quot;c\u1eafn ti\u1ec1n&quot; l\u00e0 g\u00ec?\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/cb887a88-f378-45d8-96dd-3c1b023789a2.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/cb887a88-f378-45d8-96dd-3c1b023789a2-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/cb887a88-f378-45d8-96dd-3c1b023789a2-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/cb887a88-f378-45d8-96dd-3c1b023789a2-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/cb887a88-f378-45d8-96dd-3c1b023789a2-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5234\" class=\"wp-caption-text\"><em>GMV Max kh\u00f4ng &#8220;c\u1eafn ti\u1ec1n&#8221; l\u00e0 g\u00ec?<\/em><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-LUNUd9EEeonuCbxbtcelmW4Qgrf\">Kh\u00e1i ni\u1ec7m c\u01a1 b\u1ea3n<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UOwldcLRUo6bxgxvDb9laOvTg1g\">Trong l\u0129nh v\u1ef1c qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o, c\u00e1c thu\u1eadt ng\u1eef n\u00e0y \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c hi\u1ec3u nh\u01b0 sau:<\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AwH2d7fYIoGz7bxaVh4lFJe8gcm\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>&#8220;C\u1eafn ti\u1ec1n&#8221;<\/strong>: L\u00e0 thu\u1eadt ng\u1eef quen thu\u1ed9c ch\u1ec9 vi\u1ec7c chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o \u0111\u00e3 b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng, ti\u00eau ng\u00e2n s\u00e1ch v\u00e0 ph\u00e2n ph\u1ed1i n\u1ed9i dung \u0111\u1ebfn ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JTOqdY6qEon4AZx3Bqtly8o5gn4\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>&#8220;Kh\u00f4ng c\u1eafn ti\u1ec1n&#8221;<\/strong>: L\u00e0 t\u00ecnh tr\u1ea1ng chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch GMV Max kh\u00f4ng th\u1ec3 ti\u00eau h\u1ebft ng\u00e2n s\u00e1ch b\u1ea1n \u0111\u00e3 c\u00e0i \u0111\u1eb7t, ho\u1eb7c t\u1ec7 h\u01a1n l\u00e0 kh\u00f4ng ti\u00eau m\u1ed9t \u0111\u1ed3ng n\u00e0o d\u00f9 \u0111\u00e3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ph\u00ea duy\u1ec7t v\u00e0 k\u00edch ho\u1ea1t.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-NWN3dptlxouzt6xGHm5ltmJxgec\">H\u1eadu qu\u1ea3<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DzihdO4K6oO9otx4jf9lVbe9gge\">Vi\u1ec7c qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ea1y g\u00e2y ra nh\u1eefng \u1ea3nh h\u01b0\u1edfng tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp \u0111\u1ebfn kinh doanh:<\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WttVddn6QoJVjfxj92VlNirwg4d\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>M\u1ea5t c\u01a1 h\u1ed9i ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng<\/strong>: B\u1ea1n b\u1ecf l\u1ee1 nh\u1eefng kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng ti\u1ec1m n\u0103ng \u0111ang c\u00f3 nhu c\u1ea7u mua s\u1eafm.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KbTgdeqvwoyK4Vxw3kBlfFJkgVh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>L\u00e3ng ph\u00ed th\u1eddi gian v\u00e0 c\u00f4ng s\u1ee9c<\/strong>: N\u1ed7 l\u1ef1c l\u00ean k\u1ebf ho\u1ea1ch v\u00e0 c\u00e0i \u0111\u1eb7t chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch tr\u1edf n\u00ean v\u00f4 ngh\u0129a.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Z5UjdqmYJoKfZHx9RCglWtVBgah\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Gi\u00e1n \u0111o\u1ea1n lu\u1ed3ng doanh thu<\/strong>: M\u1ee5c ti\u00eau doanh s\u1ed1 b\u1ecb \u1ea3nh h\u01b0\u1edfng nghi\u00eam tr\u1ecdng v\u00ec k\u00eanh qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o ch\u00ednh b\u1ecb \u0111\u00ecnh tr\u1ec7.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-TSxbddhGQohq3kxCBlqlvsM3gBb\">C\u00e1c nguy\u00ean nh\u00e2n ch\u00ednh khi\u1ebfn GMV Max kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ea1y<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EENLdbL2VownL6xrW9olyNX4gBb\">V\u1ea5n \u0111\u1ec1 n\u00e0y th\u01b0\u1eddng xu\u1ea5t ph\u00e1t t\u1eeb ba nh\u00f3m nguy\u00ean nh\u00e2n ch\u00ednh: Ng\u00e2n s\u00e1ch &amp; Gi\u00e1 th\u1ea7u, Nh\u00f3m \u0111\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng, v\u00e0 S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m &amp; N\u1ed9i dung.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<ol class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ENlHdTO6poIBFxxkAaSldTZZgYg\" start=\"1\">\n<li data-list=\"number\">\n<h3 class=\"heading-3\">V\u1ea5n \u0111\u1ec1 v\u1ec1 Ng\u00e2n s\u00e1ch v\u00e0 Gi\u00e1 th\u1ea7u<\/h3>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-Klq1d6PepoEWhrxk7V3l76M5gTc\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;2b29d8fe-ed6b-41a4-a321-c6c616a18196&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FGgzebqTgdorEKbxHrBnl9KRNgJb%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;GgzebqTgdorEKbxHrBnl9KRNgJb&quot;,&quot;image