 ch\u00ed chi ti\u1ebft (v\u00ed d\u1ee5: s\u1edf th\u00edch A + h\u00e0nh vi B + \u0111\u1ed9 tu\u1ed5i C trong m\u1ed9t khu v\u1ef1c nh\u1ecf), khi\u1ebfn t\u1ec7p kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau qu\u00e1 nh\u1ecf \u0111\u1ec3 h\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng ph\u00e2n ph\u1ed1i m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KlAgdlfproJPnaxDTGrlXKhZgEd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Th\u1ee9 h\u1ea1ng qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o th\u1ea5p (Ad Rank)<\/strong>: K\u1ec3 c\u1ea3 khi c\u00f3 ng\u00e2n s\u00e1ch, h\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng s\u1ebd \u01b0u ti\u00ean hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb nh\u1eefng qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111\u00e1nh gi\u00e1 l\u00e0 ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng v\u00e0 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p h\u01a1n v\u1edbi ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng. N\u1ebfu qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n b\u1ecb \u0111\u00e1nh gi\u00e1 th\u1ea5p, n\u00f3 s\u1ebd kh\u00f3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ph\u00e2n ph\u1ed1i.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<ol class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-G4FXdaYfhoTSENxyNRvlPym2gRe\" start=\"3\">\n<li data-list=\"number\">\n<h3 class=\"heading-3\">V\u1ea5n \u0111\u1ec1 v\u1ec1 S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m v\u00e0 N\u1ed9i dung<\/h3>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<figure id=\"attachment_5238\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5238\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5238\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/2157146e-fa44-4189-b677-fd1d04e87bae.png\" alt=\"V\u1ea5n \u0111\u1ec1 v\u1ec1 S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m v\u00e0 N\u1ed9i dung\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/2157146e-fa44-4189-b677-fd1d04e87bae.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/2157146e-fa44-4189-b677-fd1d04e87bae-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/2157146e-fa44-4189-b677-fd1d04e87bae-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/2157146e-fa44-4189-b677-fd1d04e87bae-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/2157146e-fa44-4189-b677-fd1d04e87bae-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5238\" class=\"wp-caption-text\"><em>V\u1ea5n \u0111\u1ec1 v\u1ec1 S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m v\u00e0 N\u1ed9i dung<\/em><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<div data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;f6841aa2-61cd-4f4b-8406-0c42574db02f&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FKuOubO8e3oXcUlxA5WAlK89ognc%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;KuOubO8e3oXcUlxA5WAlK89ognc&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:381875,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div data-page-id=\"Kd8cdNrIEo6xAzx8fxllbtN6gac\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RxYNdszzDoos4fxIqBUllLRjgHh\">Ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng n\u1ed9i dung v\u00e0 s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m l\u00e0 y\u1ebfu t\u1ed1 quy\u1ebft \u0111\u1ecbnh s\u1ef1 th\u00e0nh c\u00f4ng tr\u00ean TikTok.<\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZFw1doiJWoIIs5xf60hl1qA2gdc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng video\/s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m k\u00e9m<\/strong>: Video qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o c\u00f3 n\u1ed9i dung kh\u00f4ng h\u1ea5p d\u1eabn, h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh m\u1edd, \u00e2m thanh k\u00e9m, ho\u1eb7c kh\u00f4ng l\u00e0m n\u1ed5i b\u1eadt \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u1ee3i \u00edch c\u1ee7a s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m s\u1ebd kh\u00f4ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng \u0111\u00f3n nh\u1eadn, v\u00e0 thu\u1eadt to\u00e1n TikTok c\u0169ng s\u1ebd h\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf ph\u00e2n ph\u1ed1i. \u0110\u1ec3 t\u1ea1o ra nh\u1eefng video chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p v\u00e0 thu h\u00fat, b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 tham kh\u1ea3o c\u00e1c <strong><a href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/dich-vu\/\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t video \u0111a n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng<\/a><\/strong>.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SO9Ddj9dRofjNkxbS3ZlROxkgtb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Trang s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m kh\u00f4ng t\u1ed1i \u01b0u<\/strong>: Kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng nh\u1ea5p v\u00e0o qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o nh\u01b0ng trang s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m l\u1ea1i thi\u1ebfu h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh th\u1ef1c t\u1ebf, m\u00f4 t\u1ea3 s\u01a1 s\u00e0i, kh\u00f4ng c\u00f3 video minh h\u1ecda v\u00e0 thi\u1ebfu \u0111\u00e1nh gi\u00e1 t\u00edch c\u1ef1c s\u1ebd l\u00e0m gi\u1ea3m t\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed5i. \u0110i\u1ec1u n\u00e0y khi\u1ebfn thu\u1eadt to\u00e1n \u0111\u00e1nh gi\u00e1 qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n kh\u00f4ng hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 v\u00e0 gi\u1ea3m ph\u00e2n ph\u1ed1i.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TCQddiOpvoIJ8fxWOe3lt9qggEd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m kh\u00f4ng ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi xu h\u01b0\u1edbng<\/strong>: B\u1ea1n \u0111ang c\u1ed1 g\u1eafng qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o m\u1ed9t s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u00e3 l\u1ed7i th\u1eddi ho\u1eb7c c\u00f3 nhu c\u1ea7u th\u1ea5p tr\u00ean th\u1ecb tr\u01b0\u1eddng, khi\u1ebfn qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o kh\u00f3 t\u00ecm \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ng\u01b0\u1eddi quan t\u00e2m.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-FYtbdJt31oIDbUxMbETlY56Ogmh\">H\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn kh\u1eafc ph\u1ee5c chi ti\u1ebft theo t\u1eebng nguy\u00ean nh\u00e2n<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-To6adMg4VoRVT5x1JiPl41q5gmb\">Sau khi x\u00e1c \u0111\u1ecbnh \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c nguy\u00ean nh\u00e2n, h\u00e3y \u00e1p d\u1ee5ng c\u00e1c gi\u1ea3i ph\u00e1p t\u01b0\u01a1ng \u1ee9ng d\u01b0\u1edbi \u0111\u00e2y.<\/div>\n<ol class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-O4A9dKywioAJJpxDmjvlyZPwg8b\" start=\"1\">\n<li data-list=\"number\">\n<h3 class=\"heading-3\">T\u1ed1i \u01b0u Ng\u00e2n s\u00e1ch v\u00e0 Gi\u00e1 th\u1ea7u<\/h3>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-R30MdPo8joidGKxg4q9lzQ0Hg5b\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;7c421e65-b592-41c9-999d-a3d5c8714bdb&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FLqz6b2zBioAoGjxq28wlpZfRgUA%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;Lqz6b2zBioAoGjxq28wlpZfRgUA&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:175863,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_5239\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5239\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5239\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/435a698e-2bc8-40aa-abed-0573c24b69a4.png\" alt=\"T\u1ed1i \u01b0u Ng\u00e2n s\u00e1ch v\u00e0 Gi\u00e1 th\u1ea7u\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/435a698e-2bc8-40aa-abed-0573c24b69a4.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/435a698e-2bc8-40aa-abed-0573c24b69a4-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/435a698e-2bc