b\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Ki\u1ec3m tra v\u00e0 \u0111i\u1ec1u ch\u1ec9nh Gi\u00e1 th\u1ea7u<\/strong>: V\u1edbi GMV Max, b\u1ea1n n\u00ean \u01b0u ti\u00ean \u0111\u1eb7t gi\u00e1 th\u1ea7u t\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ed9ng \u0111\u1ec3 h\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng t\u1ef1 t\u1ed1i \u01b0u. N\u1ebfu ph\u1ea3i \u0111\u1eb7t gi\u00e1 th\u1ea7u th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng, h\u00e3y b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u v\u1edbi m\u1ee9c gi\u00e1 m\u00e0 TikTok \u0111\u1ec1 xu\u1ea5t v\u00e0 theo d\u00f5i, \u0111i\u1ec1u ch\u1ec9nh d\u1ea7n d\u1ea7n \u0111\u1ec3 c\u1ea3i thi\u1ec7n kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng c\u1ea1nh tranh.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<ol class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Q9axdNrV2o5EYIxPo6hloDEigs1\" start=\"2\">\n<li data-list=\"number\">\n<h3 class=\"heading-3\">M\u1edf r\u1ed9ng v\u00e0 t\u1ed1i \u01b0u Nh\u00f3m \u0111\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng<\/h3>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-Co8WdCVico8IMKxyAOzljyPWgxs\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;ebc21002-5f40-46ed-bae3-c4c29106c4dc&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FZumcb6SRLofJkOxvkkAlV0nrgog%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;Zumcb6SRLofJkOxvkkAlV0nrgog&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:249208,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_5240\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5240\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5240\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/142934a6-906d-4cf0-81de-dabe49b5ac2d.png\" alt=\"M\u1edf r\u1ed9ng v\u00e0 t\u1ed1i \u01b0u Nh\u00f3m \u0111\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/142934a6-906d-4cf0-81de-dabe49b5ac2d.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/142934a6-906d-4cf0-81de-dabe49b5ac2d-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/142934a6-906d-4cf0-81de-dabe49b5ac2d-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/142934a6-906d-4cf0-81de-dabe49b5ac2d-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/142934a6-906d-4cf0-81de-dabe49b5ac2d-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5240\" class=\"wp-caption-text\"><em>M\u1edf r\u1ed9ng v\u00e0 t\u1ed1i \u01b0u Nh\u00f3m \u0111\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng<\/em><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div data-page-id=\"Kd8cdNrIEo6xAzx8fxllbtN6gac\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SmqxdRiC7oWhJzxbr30ly1Z8gKh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng \u0111\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng r\u1ed9ng h\u01a1n<\/strong>: Thay v\u00ec b\u00f3 h\u1eb9p \u0111\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng v\u1edbi qu\u00e1 nhi\u1ec1u ti\u00eau ch\u00ed, h\u00e3y th\u1eed b\u1ecf b\u1edbt m\u1ed9t v\u00e0i l\u1edbp target chi ti\u1ebft. V\u1edbi GMV Max, h\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng c\u00f3 kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng t\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ed9ng t\u00ecm ki\u1ebfm nh\u1eefng kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng ti\u1ec1m n\u0103ng nh\u1ea5t trong m\u1ed9t t\u1ec7p \u0111\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng r\u1ed9ng.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DGrtdxDFQoY65ixcHnVlIgd2gIh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>T\u1ea1o \u0111\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u1ef1 (Lookalike Audience)<\/strong>: \u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 c\u1ef1c k\u1ef3 m\u1ea1nh m\u1ebd. H\u00e3y t\u1ea3i l\u00ean t\u1ec7p d\u1eef li\u1ec7u kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng c\u0169 (s\u1ed1 \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i, email) v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ec3 TikTok t\u1ea1o ra m\u1ed9t t\u1ec7p \u0111\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng m\u1edbi c\u00f3 h\u00e0nh vi v\u00e0 s\u1edf th\u00edch t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u1ef1. \u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 c\u00e1ch hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 \u0111\u1ec3 ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn nh\u1eefng kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng m\u1edbi c\u00f3 t\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed5i cao.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<ol class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SLbedmFa2ofHg7xALzGlGmTygBl\" start=\"3\">\n<li data-list=\"number\">\n<h3 class=\"heading-3\">C\u1ea3i thi\u1ec7n ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m v\u00e0 N\u1ed9i dung<\/h3>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-LZVDdDbrZow9Qpx4ZyUlcuOkgxf\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;450e997d-a35d-42b2-aea6-f5d2c064b33a&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FF6lJbafHgolaK1xangnlkGviged%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;F6lJbafHgolaK1xangnlkGviged&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:661620,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;450e997d-a35d-42b2-aea6-f5d2c064b33a&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finterna