g c\u00e1o m\u1edbi v\u1edbi c\u00e1c g\u00f3c quay, k\u1ecbch b\u1ea3n, v\u00e0 l\u1eddi k\u00eau g\u1ecdi h\u00e0nh \u0111\u1ed9ng kh\u00e1c nhau. T\u1eadp trung v\u00e0o vi\u1ec7c gi\u1ea3i quy\u1ebft v\u1ea5n \u0111\u1ec1 cho kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng v\u00e0 th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb \u0111\u1ed9c nh\u1ea5t c\u1ee7a s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IB29dr8ZSoRkJOxtssdlkaLTgrh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>T\u1ed1i \u01b0u trang s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m<\/strong>: \u0110\u1ea7u t\u01b0 v\u00e0o vi\u1ec7c ch\u1ee5p \u1ea3nh v\u00e0 quay video s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p. Vi\u1ebft l\u1ea1i m\u00f4 t\u1ea3 s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch chi ti\u1ebft, h\u1ea5p d\u1eabn, bao g\u1ed3m \u0111\u1ea7y \u0111\u1ee7 th\u00f4ng tin v\u1ec1 c\u00f4ng d\u1ee5ng, ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u, h\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng. T\u00edch c\u1ef1c khuy\u1ebfn kh\u00edch kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng c\u0169 \u0111\u1ec3 l\u1ea1i \u0111\u00e1nh gi\u00e1 \u0111\u1ec3 t\u0103ng uy t\u00edn.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UX1BdRRCpoIl8kxqcSAlYXqGgAt\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Nghi\u00ean c\u1ee9u th\u1ecb tr\u01b0\u1eddng<\/strong>: D\u00e0nh th\u1eddi gian l\u01b0\u1edbt TikTok, s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng c\u00e1c c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 ph\u00e2n t\u00edch xu h\u01b0\u1edbng \u0111\u1ec3 xem s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m n\u00e0o \u0111ang \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c quan t\u00e2m. \u0110\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n v\u1eabn c\u00f2n nhu c\u1ea7u v\u00e0 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi th\u1ecb hi\u1ebfu hi\u1ec7n t\u1ea1i.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-Cd3hdq1qvocwgaxSn6HlHY7hghA\">Nh\u1eefng l\u01b0u \u00fd kh\u00e1c<\/h2>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XIILdP8mgoASLZx9hLslgY0WgIg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Ki\u1ec3m tra t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n<\/strong>: Truy c\u1eadp Tr\u00ecnh qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o TikTok v\u00e0 ki\u1ec3m tra xem t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 b\u1ecb g\u1eafn c\u1edd, gi\u1edbi h\u1ea1n hay vi ph\u1ea1m ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch n\u00e0o kh\u00f4ng.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LeIedb71jotl3Sxx79qlFMKOgZf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Ki\u1ec3m tra tr\u1ea1ng th\u00e1i s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m<\/strong>: Trong TikTok Shop Seller Center, h\u00e3y \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o r\u1eb1ng s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m b\u1ea1n mu\u1ed1n qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o \u0111\u00e3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c duy\u1ec7t v\u00e0 \u0111ang \u1edf tr\u1ea1ng th\u00e1i &#8220;Ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng&#8221;.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZgkrdXbGdoVDNTxtl9LlyR1agzb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Ph\u00e2n t\u00edch d\u1eef li\u1ec7u<\/strong>: Khi qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o \u0111\u00e3 b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u &#8220;c\u1eafn ti\u1ec1n&#8221;, h\u00e3y theo d\u00f5i s\u00e1t sao c\u00e1c ch\u1ec9 s\u1ed1 nh\u01b0 CTR (T\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 nh\u1ea5p), CVR (T\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed5i), v\u00e0 chi ph\u00ed. D\u1eef li\u1ec7u n\u00e0y s\u1ebd cho b\u1ea1n bi\u1ebft \u0111i\u1ec3m y\u1ebfu c\u1ee7a chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch n\u1eb1m \u1edf \u0111\u00e2u \u0111\u1ec3 k\u1ecbp th\u1eddi kh\u1eafc ph\u1ee5c.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ov6WdTc6xotTjYxw3NUlQVsug0e\">T\u00ecnh tr\u1ea1ng GMV Max kh\u00f4ng c\u1eafn ti\u1ec1n l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t th\u1eed th\u00e1ch ph\u1ed5 bi\u1ebfn nh\u01b0ng ho\u00e0n to\u00e0n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 kh\u1eafc ph\u1ee5c \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c. Nguy\u00ean nh\u00e2n th\u01b0\u1eddng xoay quanh ba y\u1ebfu t\u1ed1 c\u1ed1t l\u00f5i: <strong>Ng\u00e2n s\u00e1ch &#8211; \u0110\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng &#8211; N\u1ed9i dung<\/strong>. B\u1eb1ng c\u00e1ch ki\u1ec3m tra v\u00e0 t\u1ed1i \u01b0u m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch c\u00f3 h\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng theo c\u00e1c h\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn c\u1ee7a Lemon Digital \u1edf tr\u00ean, b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 &#8220;\u0111\u00e1nh th\u1ee9c&#8221; chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch c\u1ee7a m\u00ecnh, \u0111\u01b0a s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn \u0111\u00fang kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng v\u00e0 quay tr\u1edf l\u1ea1i \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng \u0111ua doanh thu.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VpvcdfLq8oZbfrxmY5ZlI7Zugrc\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Df0sdvMStoHaeTxWbnml7pfOg2b\"><strong>C\u00d4NG TY C\u1ed4 PH\u1ea6N LEMON DIGITAL<\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LJSbdP2ngoLvuWxcalUloYewgxd\"><strong>\u0110\u1ecba ch\u1ec9: <\/strong>202 Phan V\u0103n H\u00e2n, Ph\u01b0\u1eddng Gia \u0110\u1ecbnh, H\u1ed3 Ch\u00ed Minh, Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KdjldKVxGo8lmfxK63ClIm7lgxg\"><strong>\u0110i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i: <\/strong>0938785735<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QHzVdUPcnoQ8M7x3J6glw8Wmglh\"><strong>Email: <\/strong><strong><a href=\"mailto:hi@lemondigital.vn\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">hi@lemondigital.vn<\/a><\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TwGldp0Skol8FvxujOhlpHesgXe\"><strong>Website: <\/strong><strong><a href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/<\/a><\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N10UdnDM8oTNJDx3QXql8UYng6g\"><strong>Facebook: <\/strong><strong><a href=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/lemondigital.vn\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">Lemon Digital<\/a><\/strong><\/div>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>B\u1ea1n \u0111\u00e3 c\u1ea9n th\u1eadn thi\u1ebft l\u1eadp m\u1ed9t chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch GMV Max v\u1edbi k\u1ef3 v\u1ecdng b\u00f9ng n\u1ed5 doanh thu, nh\u01b0ng sau nhi\u1ec1u gi\u1edd ch\u1edd \u0111\u1ee3i, ng\u00e2n s\u00e1ch v\u1eabn &#8220;im l\u00ecm&#8221; kh\u00f4ng h\u1ec1 suy chuy\u1ec3n? T\u00ecnh tr\u1ea1ng qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o kh\u00f4ng &#8220;c\u1eafn ti\u1ec1n&#8221; l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t v\u1ea5n \u0111\u1ec1 ph\u1ed5 bi\u1ebfn nh\u01b0ng l\u1ea1i g\u00e2y ra kh\u00f4ng \u00edt hoang mang. Trong [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":5,"featured_media":5699,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[29,1],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-5233","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-kien-thuc-tiktok","category-tin-tuc"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/5233","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/5"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=5233"}],"version-history":[{"count":5,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/5233\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":5424,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/5233\/revisions\/5424"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/5699"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=5233"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=5233"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=5233"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}